<title>GERMANY: Buba allots 71.9 bln marks in tender at 3.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba allots 71.9 bln marks in tender at 3.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it allocated 71.9 billion marks of securities repurchase funds at this week's tender at a fixed rate of 3.00 percent.</p>
<p>The new repo fully offsets an expiring pact.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank said banks bid for 290.7 billion marks of the repurchase funds this week. It accepted 24.75 percent of the bids made.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
